Description: Nexus Command Center (native NexusOS system management)
 One native Qt 6/QML application to manage NexusOS: overview, Software Center
 (APT/dpkg), system settings (with KDE settings modules), terminal and SSH
 workspace with Secret Service credentials and SFTP, Docker containers and
 Compose, Nexus applications, the NGINX gateway, storage, network, files,
 local AI (Ollama) with a native chat, notifications, security and activity
 history.
 .
 Resource-efficient by design: modules load on demand, monitoring only runs
 while a page is visible, no browser engine, no background daemon. Privileged
 work goes through nexusos-management-agent (polkit).
